## Graphical abstract
A novel colorimetric luminescent probe has been designed by encapsulating excellent $\mathrm{Eu}^{3+}$ into InMOF, showing high sensitivity and selectivity of chloroform among several small molecules, as well as $\mathrm{MnO}_{4}^{-}$ among anions.
